{PLAYSND "環境音\電車進行中トンネル.ogg" "SE2" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm sure that once the curse-killings are solved, everyone will be happy. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, of course, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="20">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="18">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">―everyone, everyone!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　And then I'll be so happy!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\電車昼.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I'll solve it not just for me, but for <STYLE ID="20">Haruka</STYLE>, and for <STYLE ID="1">Goto-chan</STYLE> herself.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto-chan</STYLE> may not look it, but she seems very loyal.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's a corny way to think, but if we all join forces like this, I'm sure we can reach the truth.<PG>
Thank you, <STYLE ID="1">Goto-chan</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I will get to the truth of the case, without fail.<PG>
